{"id":"question.pharmacology.general.renal-excretion-ionization.001","kind":"original_concept_question","lessonId":"pharmacology.general.renal-excretion-ionization","media":{"items":[{"diagramRef":"diagram.free-fraction-filtration-clearance","id":"question.pharmacology.general.renal-excretion-ionization.001.media.question-free-fraction-filtration-clearance","stage":"question","type":"diagram"},{"columns":[{"id":"c0","label":"항목"},{"id":"c1","label":"자료"}],"id":"question.pharmacology.general.renal-excretion-ionization.001.case0863","rows":[{"cells":["배설 경로","사구체여과만"],"id":"r0"},{"cells":["GFR","6L/시간"],"id":"r1"},{"cells":["fu","0.5"],"id":"r2"},{"cells":["분비·재흡수","없음"],"id":"r3"}],"stage":"question","title":"실험 및 관찰 자료","type":"table"}],"schemaVersion":"1.0.0"},"options":[{"id":"A","text":"1.5L/시간"},{"id":"B","text":"3L/시간"},{"id":"C","text":"6L/시간"},{"id":"D","text":"9L/시간"},{"id":"E","text":"12L/시간"}],"prompt":"약물이 사구체여과로만 배설된다. GFR은 6L/시간이고 혈장 자유분율 fu는 0.5이며 세뇨관 분비와 재흡수는 없다. 총 혈장 농도를 기준으로 한 신장청소율은?","verificationStatus":"editorial_draft_not_exam_validated"}